# 8. AI Chat APIs

The AI Chat APIs power the conversational intelligence of KnowledgeOS.

Unlike a traditional chatbot, these APIs interact with the complete AI pipeline involving retrieval, planning, prompt construction, response validation, memory management, and insight generation.

Every conversation is isolated per authenticated user and operates exclusively on that user's knowledge base.

---

