## Create New Chat

```http
POST /api/v1/chat
```

Purpose

Creates a new chat session.

Request

```json
{
    "title": "System Design Interview"
}
```

If no title is provided, the AI automatically generates one after the first conversation.

---

## Get All Chats

```http
GET /api/v1/chat
```

Returns

- Chat ID
- Title
- Last Message
- Last Updated
- Message Count

Supports

- Pagination
- Search
- Sorting

---

## Get Chat

```http
GET /api/v1/chat/{chat_id}
```

Returns

- Session Metadata
- Entire Conversation
- AI Statistics

---

## Send Message

```http
POST /api/v1/chat/{chat_id}/message
```

Purpose

Processes a user message through the complete AI pipeline.

Request

```json
{
    "message": "Explain normalization using my DBMS notes."
}
```

Returns

```json
{
    "response": "...",
    "citations": [...],
    "response_time_ms": 2143
}
```

Streaming is enabled by default.

---

## Stream Response

```text
POST /api/v1/chat/{chat_id}/stream
```

Returns Server-Sent Events (SSE) for token-by-token streaming.

Example

```text
data: Token 1

data: Token 2

data: Token 3
```

The final message is stored only after generation completes successfully.

---

## Rename Chat

```http
PATCH /api/v1/chat/{chat_id}
```

Allows users to manually rename conversations.

---

## Delete Chat

```http
DELETE /api/v1/chat/{chat_id}
```

Deletes

- Chat Session
- Chat Messages

Insights remain unaffected.

---

## Share Chat

```http
POST /api/v1/chat/{chat_id}/share
```

Creates a shareable public link.

Future Enhancement

- Password Protected Links
- Expiration Date
- Read Only Mode

---

## Download Chat

```http
GET /api/v1/chat/{chat_id}/download
```

Supported Formats

- PDF
- Markdown

This powers the download menu available from the chat interface.

---

## Search Conversations

```http
GET /api/v1/chat/search
```

Supports searching across

- Chat Titles
- User Messages
- Assistant Messages

