# 9. Insights APIs

Insights are AI-generated observations created asynchronously.

Unlike conversations, insights are proactively generated by background AI agents.

---

## Get Insights

```http
GET /api/v1/insights
```

Returns

- Knowledge Gaps
- Connections
- Recommendations
- Learning Progress
- Roadmaps
- Trends

Supports

- Pagination
- Filtering
- Sorting

---

## Get Insight

```http
GET /api/v1/insights/{insight_id}
```

Returns

- Title
- Content
- Supporting Documents
- Supporting Chunks
- Confidence Score

---

## Generate Insights

```http
POST /api/v1/insights/generate
```

Triggers background insight generation.

Returns

```http
202 Accepted
```

---

## Bookmark Insight

```http
PATCH /api/v1/insights/{insight_id}/bookmark
```

Marks an insight as bookmarked.

---

## Delete Insight

```http
DELETE /api/v1/insights/{insight_id}
```

Removes a generated insight.

This operation does not affect uploaded documents.

---

## Regenerate Insight

```http
POST /api/v1/insights/{insight_id}/regenerate
```

Rebuilds the insight using the latest knowledge base.

---

# 10. Search APIs

KnowledgeOS supports multiple search strategies.

---

## Global Search

```http
GET /api/v1/search
```

Supports

- Documents
- Chats
- Insights

Request

```text
/search?q=normalization
```

---

## Semantic Search

```http
POST /api/v1/search/semantic
```

Uses ChromaDB similarity search.

Request

```json
{
    "query": "database normalization"
}
```

Returns

- Matching Chunks
- Similarity Scores
- Source Documents

---

## Keyword Search

```http
POST /api/v1/search/keyword
```

Performs PostgreSQL full-text search.

Useful for

- Filenames
- Exact phrases
- Metadata

---

## Hybrid Search

```http
POST /api/v1/search/hybrid
```

Combines

- Semantic Search
- Keyword Search

↓

Reciprocal Rank Fusion

↓

Final Ranking

↓

Top Results

Hybrid search provides higher retrieval quality than either approach alone.

---

## Search Suggestions

```http
GET /api/v1/search/suggestions
```

Returns autocomplete suggestions while typing.

Suggestions may include

- Document Names
- Folder Names
- Chat Titles
- Frequently Asked Topics

---

## Recent Searches (Future)

```http
GET /api/v1/search/history
```

Returns recent search history for the authenticated user.

May later support favorites and pinned searches.

